Z||000035||BAM-BAM||10-28-2000||11:25 PM||||  OH GEEZ, I go out of town for the day and look; I get involved in something like this. Mr. Holdwick or whatever your name is, if you had taken the time to read the post I made you would see that these are not, "MY" cars. First off the COUNT wanted ideas of what others have done to their notchbacks. Secondly, an individual taking the time to post pictures of what they are proud of is in no way showing a lack of MORALS. thirdly you have just been added to a list of undesirables that is relatively short (thank GOD) and not so distinguished. <P>  Count, I do have pictures of my car before any of the current mods. The ones I have do show my 2000 Mustang spoiler addition. My interior pieces shipped yesterday from Mr.Mikes, but I won't be installing them right away. I am working on a couple little trick things for my interior and I want all things to be in order before I put it together. I will, however take pics of the seats when they arrive. When the interior is finished it will be one to envy. I can say that for I lack "morals" Being a bragger is one of my strong qualities.  <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/leftside85gt.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rightside85gt_1.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rearview85gt_1.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tightviewspoiler.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tightviewspoiler_1.jpg"> <P> Enjoy! <P> Oh, for those of you who are offended by this post, hit your back botton, this is very offensive material.<P> Later, BAM OUT!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Smile1.gif">  <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FFfart.gif">    <P>------------------<BR>Don B. <BR>85GT<BR>Eibach Springs/KYB shocks and struts<BR>Mr.Mikes 500 series seats, Carpet and headliner! MOMO Commando Steering Wheel, White Face Race Style Guages And Soon To Be More!!! YEAH BABY-YEAH||||reg||9
